From aa844ab6da1d3bf193432eb7ceff22e617af883d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:56:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add real-time glass blur behind the keyboard

Blur the content behind the keyboard with a non-touchable sub-window placed
under the keyboard view (cross-window blur, Android 12+), and fall back to the
static theme background when blur is not available.

Adds the "Real-time glass blur" switch and radius to the theme preferences.
